<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="87a819e5">&lt;p&gt;
    Identify groups of training audiences by business area, roles and levels. Obtain an initial understanding of the
    current state of the organization’s training landscape, including a view of the required knowledge and skill levels
    across various business areas, roles and levels. Define the learning needs of the target audience groups impacted by
    the change and categorize this information into training modules designed to address any gaps.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
